OL,3,GNEWSABermondsey waste centre fire
OL,4,Adisrupts trains
OL,5,
OL,6,FSome London Overground trains remain
OL,7,Fsuspended after a fire involving 50
OL,8,Ftonnes of household waste "severely
OL,9,Fdamaged" a recycling facility in
OL,10,Fsouth-east London.
OL,12,FFifteen fire engines were called to
OL,13,FLandmann Way in South Bermondsey
OL,14,Fshortly before 20:00 BST on Tuesday,
OL,15,Faccording to London Fire Brigade (LFB),
OL,16,Fwhich said the fire was brought under
OL,17,Fcontrol six hours later.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,324,320,200,140,0,100
