OL,3,GNEWSABermondsey waste centre fire
OL,4,Adisrupts trains
OL,5,
OL,6,FNo services are running on the Windrush
OL,7,Fline from Surrey Quays to New Cross and
OL,8,FClapham Junction "due to an unsafe
OL,9,Fstructure next to the railway". Trains
OL,10,Ffrom Highbury and Islington to West
OL,11,FCroydon are severely delayed.
OL,13,FThe LFB said the cause of the fire was
OL,14,Fnot yet known. Firefighters tackled a
OL,15,Fblaze at the same facility in June.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
